            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Trump vs. Musk, Trump trade takes tumble: Market Takeaways",
            "description": "<p>US stocks (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC?p=%5EIXIC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^IXIC</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^GSPC</a>) closed Thursday's session lower amid President Trump's phone call with Chinese President Xi Jinping, and the president's social media spats with Tesla (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSLA\">TSLA</a>) CEO Elon Musk.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance senior markets reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-schafer/\">Josh Schafer</a> comes on Asking for a Trend to highlight the trading day's biggest themes, including the stock reaction from Tesla and other companies tied to the Trump Trade.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Asking for a Trend\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/asking-for-a-trend/\">here</a>.</p>",
